OL,3,GNEWSAControversial football fan station
OL,4,Aqueue plan approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FControversial plans to expand the
OL,7,Fqueuing area at a Merseyrail station
OL,8,Fused by Everton fans on matchdays will
OL,9,Fgo ahead.
OL,11,FLiverpool Council's planning committee
OL,12,Fapproved the application, which could
OL,13,Fsee an additional 2,000 supporters use
OL,14,Fan extended waiting zone at Sandhills.
OL,16,FTwo councillors at previous meeting
OL,17,Fwere criticised for comments about the
OL,18,Fplans with former Lord Mayor Richard
OL,19,FKemp comparing it to "the greeting area
OL,20,Ffor Auschwitz".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
