OL,3,GNEWSAControversial football fan station
OL,4,Aqueue plan approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe and fellow Liberal Democrat Pat
OL,7,FMoloney, who described the queuing
OL,8,Fsystem as "something out of a horrific
OL,9,Fdeath camp in Nazi Germany" apologised
OL,10,Fafter criticism from Jewish leaders and
OL,11,FLabour politicians.
